Source: https://elm-chan.org/fsw/tjpgd/ (same author as the FatFs library
already vendored in this project, third_party/no-OS-FatFS-SD-SPI-RPi-Pico/).
Fetched 2026-10-02 via the ms-rtos/tjpgd GitHub mirror
(https://github.com/ms-rtos/tjpgd), byte-identical to R0.01c as distributed
by elm-chan.org except one deliberate config change: tjpgd.h's JD_FORMAT is
set to 1 (RGB565) instead of the stock 0 (RGB888) -- see the comment at that
line.
